                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "A take records what the player heard. Its input's Pre effects are recorded into the take; its Post effects run live on the take's lane, so they ring out past Stop (#1741). At the press, a take whose Post effects would not fit beside the rest of the rig records them into the take too: they land on the take's lane at Pre. The take sounds as it was heard, and those effects stop with it on Stop. When they fit, nothing changes."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
